    "slug": "895629f663-classification-valuate-demo",
    "title": "classification_valuate_demo",
    "date": "",
    "type": "Blog",
    "summary": "Obsidian vault 同步笔记。",
    "href": "/blog/895629f663-classification-valuate-demo",
    "tags": [
      "计算机",
      "人工智能",
      "03_工程与框架",
      "02_Transformers实战"
    ],
    "content": "```python\ndef evaluate():\n    model.eval() #评估模式，关闭dropout等\n    acc_num = 0 #累计正确数量\n    with torch.inference_mode():\n        for batch in validloader:\n            if torch.cuda.is_available():\n                batch = {k: v.cuda() for k, v in batch.items()} \n                #k全部不变，v全部进cuda\n            output = model(**batch) \n            #解包batch，等价于model(input_ids=batch[\"input_ids\"], attention_mask=batch[\"attention_mask\"], labels=batch[\"labels\"])\n            pred = torch.argmax(output.logits, dim=-1) \n            #最后一维度取logits概率最大值作为分类结果\n            acc_num += (pred.long() == batch[\"labels\"].long()).float().sum()\n    return acc_num / len(validset)\n```",
    "sourcePath": "计算机/人工智能/03_工程与框架/02_Transformers实战/classification_valuate_demo.md",
