    "content": "### From PINNs to PIKANs: Recent Advances in Physics-Informed Machine Learning\n![Pasted image 20250909230917](../../../../pic/Pasted%20image%2020250909230917.png)\n### When physics meets machine learning: a survey of physics-informed machine learning\n07 May 2025\n#### Numerical methods for Partial Differential Equations (PDEs)\n偏微分方程（PDEs）的数值方法：\nFinite Difference Method 有限差分法\n- 偏微分方程的解可以通过基函数的线性组合近似\n- 该方法在离散度的选择方面提供了极大的自由，在函数 _u_ 的一个梯度较大的区域中，也可以使用较小的单元，如下所示![Pasted image 20250909233304](../../../../pic/Pasted%20image%2020250909233304.png)\n- \n### Multi-Objective Loss Balancing for Physics-Informed Deep Learning\n2025 年 5 月 1 日 190引用",
